:: win skeleton [autosave] {"position":"400,2600","size":"100,100"}
You killed the skeleton and won the battle, gaining <<print ($mobLvl*1.5 + $mobXP).toFixed(0)>> XP and $mobXP Coins<<if $lootchance lte 5>> a ring of the undead<</if>> and a crystal fragment.
<<EventCurrencies>>\
<<link "Go back">>
<<if $lootchance lte 5>>
	<<set $ringOfTheUndead += 1>>
<</if>>
<<goto $lastVisitedPassage>>
<<set $killedSK += 1>>
<<set $crystalFragments += 1>>
<<MobRewards>>
<</link>>


